 "description": "Per-track momentum scale and extra resolution for MC, fitted jointly to the mass peaks of Ds -> phi(KK) pi, J/psi -> mu mu (in B+ -> J/psi K+), B+ -> J/psi K+ (refitted J/psi + K) in data.",
